@* ショーダウンで 1 つのポットの勝者を選ぶ。複数選べばチョップ。Run it のときは回ごとに選ぶ *@
<div class="showdown-panel">
    <div class="showdown-title">
        @Label(Current)
        <span class="showdown-amount">@Chips.Format(Current.Amount)</span>
        の勝者
    </div>
    @* ポットは 1 つずつ決めるので、全体でいくつあるかが分かるように、このあと決めるポットを出す *@
    @if (LaterPots.Count > 0)
    {
        <div class="showdown-later">このあと: @string.Join(" / ", LaterPots.Select(p => $"{Label(p)} {Chips.Format(p.Amount)}"))</div>
    }
    <div class="showdown-players">
        @foreach (var p in State.Players.Where(p => Pot.EligibleIds.Contains(p.Id)))
        {
            var id = p.Id;
            <button type="button" class="winner-btn @(_selected.Contains(id) ? "winner-on" : "")" @onclick="() => Toggle(id)">
                <span class="player-color" style="background:@Chips.PlayerColors[p.ColorIndex % Chips.PlayerColors.Length]"></span>
                <span class="winner-name">@p.Name</span>
            </button>
        }
    </div>
    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" FullWidth="true" Size="Size.Large" Disabled="_selected.Count == 0"
               OnClick="Confirm">
        @(_selected.Count == 0 ? "勝者未選択" : "確定")
    </MudButton>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public GameState State { get; set; } = default!;
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public GameEngine.PendingShowdown Current { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public int Runs { get; set; } = 1;
    [Parameter] public IReadOnlyList<GameEngine.PendingShowdown> LaterPots { get; set; } = [];
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<ImmutableList<int>> OnConfirm { get; set; }

    private Pot Pot => Current.Pot;
    private readonly HashSet<int> _selected = [];
    private (int, int) _lastPot = (-1, -1);

    protected override void OnParametersSet()
    {
        if (_lastPot == (Current.Run, Current.Index)) return;
        _lastPot = (Current.Run, Current.Index);
        _selected.Clear();
    }

    private string Label(GameEngine.PendingShowdown p) =>
        (Runs > 1 ? $"{p.Run + 1} 回目 " : "") + (p.Index == 0 ? "Main pot" : "Side pot");

    private void Toggle(int id)
    {
        if (!_selected.Remove(id)) _selected.Add(id);
    }

    private Task Confirm() => OnConfirm.InvokeAsync(Pot.EligibleIds.Where(_selected.Contains).ToImmutableList());
}
